# Unrelated files go to Downloads/cursor-assets

`shared-apex-static` is only for fleet/static conversion work.

Save generated images, reference photos, personal notes, and any file **not** part of static conversion to:

`C:\Users\My PC\Downloads\cursor-assets`

Do **not** create folders like `pcb-fuse-reference` or other off-topic assets inside this repo.
